#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2788
msgid ""
"This section describes the one sample Wilcoxon signed rank test to test the "
"null hypothesis that the sample comes from a population with the given "
"median. The tool to perform a Wilcoxon signed rank test to test the null "
"hypothesis that two paired samples come from populations with the same "
"median is in section <xref linkend=\"two-median-wilcoxon-sign-test-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet beskrivs Wilcoxons teckenrangtest för ett urval, som "
"prövar nollhypotesen att urvalet kommer från en population med den angivna "
"medianen. Verktyget för Wilcoxons teckenrangtest av nollhypotesen att två "
"parade urval kommer från populationer med samma median beskrivs i avsnittet "
"<xref linkend=\"two-median-wilcoxon-sign-test-tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2799
msgid ""
"The Wilcoxon Signed Rank TTest tool performs a one-sample sign test whether "
"the sample comes from a population with a given median."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget Wilcoxon teckenrangtest prövar med ett urval om det kommer från en"
" population med en viss median."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2813
msgid ""
"The p-values given by this tool are determined using a normal approximation."
" This approximation is only valid if the sample size is at least 12."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget beräknar p-värden med en normalapproximation. Approximationen är "
"bara giltig om urvalsstorleken är minst 12."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2821
msgid "Using the Wilcoxon Signed Rank Test Tool"
msgstr "Använda Wilcoxons teckenrangtest"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2822
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to perform a Wilcoxon Signed Rank Test on the data given in"
" <xref linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog\"/> to determine whether the sample "
"comes from a population of mean 3."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill utföra Wilcoxons teckenrangtest på data i <xref "
"linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog\"/> för att avgöra om urvalet kommer från "
"en population med medianen 3."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2837
msgid ""
"On the <quote><guibutton>Test</guibutton></quote> tab of the dialog (see "
"<xref linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog-test-tab\"/>) select the Wilcoxon "
"Signed Rank Test."
msgstr ""
"Välj Wilcoxons teckenrangtest på fliken "
"<quote><guibutton>Test</guibutton></quote> i dialogrutan (se <xref "
"linkend=\"one-median-tool-dialog-test-tab\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2850
msgid ""
"The output of this sign test is shown in <xref linkend=\"wilcoxon-sign-test-"
"dialog-output\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet från teckenrangtestet visas i <xref linkend=\"wilcoxon-sign-test-"
"dialog-output\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2856
msgid "Output of a Wilcoxon Signed Rank Test"
msgstr "Resultat från Wilcoxons teckenrangtest"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2858
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-signtest-ex3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the output "
"of a Wilcoxon Signed Rank Test.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-signtest-ex3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av resultatet "
"från Wilcoxons teckenrangtest.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2877
msgid "Two Sample Tests"
msgstr "Test för två urval"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2880
msgid "Comparing Means of Two Populations"
msgstr "Jämförelse av medelvärden för två populationer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2881
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> provides four similar tools to test "
"whether the difference of two population means is equal to a hypothesized "
"value. These four tools use the same dialog (see <xref linkend=\"ttest-"
"dialog\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har fyra liknande verktyg för att testa "
"om skillnaden mellan två populationsmedelvärden är lika med ett hypotetiskt "
"värde. Alla fyra verktygen använder samma dialogruta (se <xref "
"linkend=\"ttest-dialog\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2887
msgid ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>- and <parameter>z</parameter>-Test Tool Dialog"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>- och <parameter>z</parameter>-testverktygens "
"dialogruta"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2891
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the t-test "
"and z-test dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan "
"för t-test och z-test.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2902
msgid ""
"Depending on the options settings, the appropriate test will be performed. "
"The entries in the <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote>, "
"<quote><guilabel>Test</guilabel></quote>, and "
"<quote><guilabel>Output</guilabel></quote> frames are independent from the "
"specific test."
msgstr ""
"Beroende på inställningarna utförs det test som passar. Fälten i rutorna "
"<quote><guilabel>Inmatning</guilabel></quote>, "
"<quote><guilabel>Test</guilabel></quote> och "
"<quote><guilabel>Utdata</guilabel></quote> är desamma för alla test."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2909
msgid ""
"Enter the first variable in the <quote><guilabel>Variable 1 "
"Range</guilabel></quote> entry and the second variable in the "
"<quote><guilabel>Variable 2 Range</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange den första variabelns område i fältet <quote><guilabel>Område för "
"variabel 1</guilabel></quote> och den andra variabelns område i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Område för variabel 2</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2912
msgid ""
"Enter the hypothesized difference between the population means in the "
"<quote><guilabel>Hypothesized Mean Difference</guilabel></quote> entry, "
"which has a default of 0. Enter the significance level in the "
"<quote><guilabel>Alpha</guilabel></quote> entry, which has a default of 5 %."
msgstr ""
"Ange den hypotetiska skillnaden mellan populationsmedelvärdena i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Hypotetisk skillnad mellan medelvärden</guilabel></quote>. "
"Standardvärdet är 0. Ange signifikansnivån i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Alfa</guilabel></quote>. Standardvärdet är 5 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2917
msgid ""
"Specify the output options as described above. If the output is printed into"
" a range, it should have at least three columns and ten rows."
msgstr ""
"Ange utdataalternativen enligt beskrivningen ovan. Om resultatet placeras i "
"ett cellområde ska det omfatta minst tre kolumner och tio rader."
